{"tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"a - b","variables":{"a":{"value":10,"source":"source:q11n3","unit":"million"},"b":{"value":4,"source":"source:q11n4","unit":"million"}},"sources":{"a":"source:q11n3","b":"source:q11n4"}},"message":"The reserve for product warranties was $10 million at Dec. 31, 2006 and $4 million at Dec. 31, 2005 (post_text segment q11). Change = 2006 reserve minus 2005 reserve = 10 - 4."}